  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"assets/icon-128.png\" width=\"72\" alt=\"dsh-plugin-wechat\" />"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-wechat",
      "text": "**在微信里养一只「大肥鱼」🐳 —— 离开电脑，你的 DeepSeek Harness 依然揣在兜里陪你闲聊、替你指挥千军万马**\n\n[**English**](README.en.md) · [**MIT License**](LICENSE)\n\n<br />\n\n<img src=\"assets/dafeiyu_story_poster.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"在微信里养一只大肥鱼 · 四格故事海报\" />\n\n</div>\n\n离开电脑时，直接用手机微信跟电脑上的 **DeepSeek Harness（DSH）** 像老朋友一样闲聊、派活、指挥后台 Agent："
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-wechat",
      "text": "- **揣在兜里随时陪聊**：散步、摸鱼、躺平时冒出新念头，不用守着电脑黑框，打开微信就能接着上下文随手聊两句。\n- **谈笑间指挥一堆 Agent 干重活**：遇到费时间的活，你只管在微信里动嘴交代，大肥鱼会在电脑后台召唤子智能体（Subagents）并行查资料、写代码、改文档；跑完出结果自动推回你微信，需要电脑里的文件说句话就能直接发给你。\n- **遥控电脑上的其他 DSH 会话**：在外面想看电脑上另一个窗口的进度，直接问“帮我看看写周报的那个会话跑到哪了？”、“让它把报错修一下”或“先停一下”。扫码认主后默认就能用，不用手抄会话 ID，也不用折腾各种白名单。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "一、一分钟安装",
      "text": "打开电脑上的 DSH，直接把下面这句话发给它，让它自己装好：\n\n```text\n请帮我安装这个微信插件，按 README 的 Agent 安装指南执行：https://github.com/xrzhai/dsh-plugin-wechat\n```\n\n安装完成后，**完整退出并重新打开一次 DSH**。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "二、扫码绑定微信",
      "text": "1. 点开 DSH 左侧栏的 **「大肥鱼 🐳」**（或打开「设置 → 大肥鱼」），在 **「微信账号」** 页点击 **「扫码登录微信」**，用手机微信扫一下。\n2. 扫完码后，用你自己的微信给它发一句“你好”或 `/status`。插件会自动把第一个发消息的你登记为主人，别人发消息它不会理。\n3. **顺手调教（可选）**：\n   - 想改助理的称呼、说话风格或日常习惯，去 **「人设」** 页直接改；\n   - 想指定它平时默认在哪个代码库或笔记目录干活，去 **「高级 → 基本设置」** 选一下默认工作文件夹。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "三、在微信里怎么用",
      "text": "平时直接像跟同事发微信一样说人话就行：\n\n- **查电脑上的其他任务**：“帮我列出最近的 DSH 会话，找一下写周报的那个。”\n- **跨会话指挥**：“看看那个会话报错没有”、“让它把测试也补上”、“让那个正在跑的会话先停下来”。\n- **拿电脑里的文件**：“把 `D:\\Projects\\report.pdf` 发给我”。\n\n如果只想把微信当纯聊天窗口、不希望它碰电脑上的其他会话，去 **「高级 → 远程查看与管理 DSH 会话」** 把开关关掉即可。更细的目录与权限说明见[跨会话调度说明](docs/session-dispatcher.md)与[安全说明](docs/security.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "常用微信口令",
      "text": "下面的口令由插件直接秒回，**不消耗模型 Token**（注：`/list` 看的是当前微信聊天里建的话题；要看桌面上的其他 DSH 会话，直接用自然语言问它）："
    },
    {
      "section": "常用微信口令",
      "text": "| 你在微信里发 | 它的作用 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `/new` 或 `/new 写周报` | **开个新话题**（之前的聊天记录还留着，随时能切回来） |\n| `/list` | **看微信话题列表**，会列出编号 `1, 2, 3...` |\n| `/use 2` | **切回第 2 个话题**接着聊 |\n| `/cancel` 或 `/取消` | **停掉当前正在生成的回复** |\n| `/compact` 或 `/压缩` | 聊太久上下文满了，发这句让它自动压缩瘦身 |\n| `/send 文件路径` | 直接把电脑上的某个文件发到你微信里 |\n| `/status` | 看看当前连没连上、正在哪个话题里 |\n| `/outbox` 或 `/outbox retry` | 看看有没有因网络波动暂存的回复，或手动补发 |\n| `/clear` | 清空微信侧的话题列表（DSH 里的历史记录仍保留） |\n| `/help` 或 `/帮助` | 忘了口令时调出小抄菜单 |\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "四、常见问题",
      "text": "- **刚装完连不上 / 提示登录过期？**\n  安装或升级插件后，记得完整退出并重新打开一次 DSH；如果隔太久微信登录过期了，去「微信账号」重新扫个码就行。\n- **笔记本合盖后收不到微信回复？**\n  电脑休眠时网络和进程会暂停，掀开盖子唤醒后它会自动重连。\n- **怎么更新到最新版？**\n  直接对电脑上的 DSH 说：“帮我把微信插件更新到最新版”，更新完重启一下 DSH 即可。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "五、Agent 安装指南（给 DSH 自己看的）",
      "text": "请将仓库克隆到固定目录（DSH 会直接链接该目录）。需要 Git、Node ≥ 22.13.0 和 pnpm；macOS 终端若找不到 `node` 或 `pnpm`，请使用 DSH 内置运行时（`~/.dsh/dsh-runtimes/...`）。将下方的 `desktop` 替换为用户实际的 profile 名称：\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/xrzhai/dsh-plugin-wechat.git\ncd dsh-plugin-wechat\npnpm install\nnode bin/install.mjs --profile desktop"
    },
    {
      "section": "五、Agent 安装指南（给 DSH 自己看的）",
      "text": "- **升级**：在仓库目录执行 `git pull`，再跑一遍 `pnpm install`、`node bin/install.mjs --profile desktop` 与 `npm run doctor -- --offline`，最后提醒用户完整重启 DSH。\n- **卸载**：执行 `node bin/install.mjs --profile desktop --uninstall`（本地凭据与历史会话默认保留在 `~/.dsh/weixin/`）。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "六、致谢与协议",
      "text": "本项目基于 [panqing0313/dsh-plugin-weixin](https://github.com/panqing0313/dsh-plugin-weixin) 与 [Tencent/openclaw-weixin](https://github.com/Tencent/openclaw-weixin) 构建，采用 [MIT License](LICENSE) 开源。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"assets/icon-128.png\" width=\"72\" alt=\"dsh-plugin-wechat\" />"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-wechat",
      "text": "**Control Your DeepSeek Harness Anytime from WeChat**\n\n[**简体中文**](README.md) · [**MIT License**](LICENSE)\n\n</div>\n\nStep away from your desk and keep using **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** right from WeChat on your phone:"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-wechat",
      "text": "- **Assign tasks and exchange local files**: Send text, voice notes, images, or documents from WeChat to have DSH research, write code, or draft reports. Need a file from your computer? Just ask *\"Send me the report on my desktop\"* or send `/send <file-path>`.\n- **Background subagents report back automatically**: When a task takes time, your assistant delegates it to background subagents, acknowledges right away, and pushes the final result to your WeChat as soon as it finishes.\n- **Check and direct other desktop DSH sessions**: Ask *\"How far did the weekly report session get?\"*, *\"Ask it to fix the failing test\"*, or *\"Stop that task for now.\"* Works out of the box for the account owner—no need to copy session IDs or configure complex allowlists."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-wechat",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "1. One-Minute Install",
      "text": "Send this prompt to DSH on your computer and let it install the plugin for you:\n\n```text\nPlease install this WeChat plugin by following the Agent installation guide in its README: https://github.com/xrzhai/dsh-plugin-wechat\n```\n\nOnce installed, **fully quit and reopen DSH**.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. Connect WeChat",
      "text": "1. Open **WeChat** in the DSH left sidebar (or **Settings → WeChat**), go to **WeChat Account**, and click **Scan QR code to log in**.\n2. Send `\"hello\"` or `/status` from your own WeChat first. The plugin automatically registers the first sender as the account owner and ignores strangers.\n3. **Optional setup**:\n   - Open **Persona** to customize how your assistant speaks and works.\n   - Open **Advanced → Basics** to pick a default working folder for your projects.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. Daily Usage",
      "text": "Just talk to it in plain language:\n\n- **Find other desktop tasks**: *\"List recent DSH sessions and find the one writing the weekly report.\"*\n- **Direct a session**: *\"Check if that session hit any errors\"*, *\"Have it add unit tests\"*, or *\"Stop that running session.\"*\n- **Fetch a local file**: *\"Send me `D:\\Projects\\report.pdf`.\"*"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. Daily Usage",
      "text": "If you only want a standalone chat assistant and don't want WeChat to touch other desktop sessions, toggle off **Advanced → View and manage DSH sessions**. See [Session Dispatcher](docs/session-dispatcher.md) and [Security Notes](docs/security.md) for optional fine-grained restrictions."
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick Commands",
      "text": "These slash commands are handled directly by the plugin without spending model tokens (`/list` shows topics inside this WeChat chat; ask in natural language to list other desktop DSH sessions):"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick Commands",
      "text": "| Send in WeChat | What It Does |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| `/new` or `/new weekly report` | **Start a new topic** (previous topics are kept so you can switch back anytime) |\n| `/list` | **List WeChat topics** (`1, 2, 3...`) |\n| `/use 2` | **Switch back to topic `#2`** |\n| `/cancel` | **Stop the current reply** |\n| `/compact` | **Compress context** when a conversation gets long |\n| `/send <file-path>` | **Send a file** from your computer to your WeChat |\n| `/status` | **Check connection status** and active topic |\n| `/outbox` or `/outbox retry` | **Check or resend** replies held up by network hiccups |\n| `/clear` | **Clear the WeChat topic list** (DSH session history stays intact) |\n| `/help` | **Show the command cheat sheet** |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick Commands",
